===== LogicalPath
{
 "type": "string",
 "minLength": 1,
 "maxLength": 4096,
 "pattern": "^[^/\\\\\\u0000]{1,255}(/[^/\\\\\\u0000]{1,255})*(?![\\s\\S])",
 "not": {
  "pattern": "(^|/)\\.\\.?(/|$)"
 },
 "description": "The logical-path grammar identity-and-evidence section 3 already states: relative, slash-separated, no empty/dot/dot-dot/NUL/backslash segment, each segment at most 255 characters. It was previously stated only in prose and enforced imperatively for scope-descriptor alone; every identity-bearing path field now carries it in the schema. Byte-identical in constraint to workflows/schemas/common.schema.json#/$defs/LogicalPath, which is what makes the import blob rows an exact mirror."
}
